=== SURVEY ===
Surveyed existing widget patterns: WidgetShell, WidgetBigNumber, RadialGauge, StatusBadge, registry.ts.
Confirmed useWatch hook exports: useWatchSummary (WatchSummary type), useWatchComplication (WatchComplication type).
WatchSummary fields: vehicle_name, state, battery_level, range_km, is_charging, charge_rate, time_to_full, is_locked, sentry_mode, inside_temp_c, outside_temp_c, is_climate_on, last_updated.
WatchComplication fields: battery, range, state, charging.
Watch icon confirmed available in lucide-react.
Unit conversion: range_km is in km (need kmToMiles for imperial), inside_temp_c is in Celsius (use convertTemp).
useSettings provides: convertTemp, tempUnit, distanceUnit, isMiles.

=== REASONING ===
Compact (1×2): Watch-face circular display — RadialGauge for battery %, StatusBadge below, range underneath. No title (WidgetShell handles freshness as overlay dot).
Standard (2×2+): WidgetShell with title + WidgetBigNumber hero for battery, then 2-column grid for Range, Lock, Cabin Temp, Last Seen.
Unit conversion: range_km → if isMiles then kmToMiles(range_km), else raw km. Temp via convertTemp(insideTempC).
All fields null-safe with ?? null fallback, EmptyState when no data.
All strings use i18n t() function.
Touch targets: min-h-[44px] on grid cells.

